05929431978", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GdclUFlFKvEQ7kNvwHHvBTZ&_nc_oc=AdpsVbILtWyPDgaRtXdUzYfeX58sII2OB_i7i7R2UjYCmwjN2YboUrFz_MHjjdknNRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAEPtaRAjK8Vewe1RGCpY-bgSRJHNVZjgFNTKIpAfDvjQ&oe=6A4F90E4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bLayqRzblP0Q7kNvwGCcWvX&_nc_oc=AdoWJxZU_pPEqb-oRWj1yeWvLzjdbfZtXNBFO1mPyLeOtowgiVSzyJ7eF0sOqKpt5-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAndQvjPTDOcK3J2gdt2XvXxfFPJDhCx6fDJz2XvzPoGQ&oe=6A4FA457"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NQU1QllBhKMQ7kNvwEZl7Ye&_nc_oc=AdpWe0rNAKyvovNvQ9NNDqNO505y_jk3clqJW2wF5uRbEGxMpTcAPYhhOSNDy_LbjPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQArR72ZNXgKISUE3SA15uAdN4sLKlAEeFiBgJOdFvO0_g&oe=6A4FBB62"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iZ0Z5kNzlWMQ7kNvwGIVeiJ&_nc_oc=AdrxuHGH5Kfpyp50OF0nnrXFJZfp6_sZ9v6AKYuxrj8eesoDSbu8OsPaDrvhKDlL8Ys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBiU3GfOmbXxzus7sLHEfDCf8LPymMWRuwCYieXHKGTlQ&oe=6A4FB65B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_Skybonk_KeyArt_2560x1440.png", "id": "919201067862598", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_919201071195931_9197008632617778577_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ZJp_PVvb40Q7kNvwHiYSRa&_nc_oc=AdqZfzJ5T1lYjutfk5IzjDaLt4z9o6M8fy6b0GpJ0k18bxYSeYyxehmeGelucPtJX8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBRnuYzrLNtZBidxQI-Uk5i2QpvusH7qK7l6MJ5ymMxA&oe=6A4FA437"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "catego